                                                "sense_id": "f0164b35-affc-395f-9633-d4a3876ae267",
                                                "text": "Where may that treachour then (said he) be found, / Or by what meanes may I his footing tract?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1cdb07dd-d5a0-3bf4-b80f-18be9f60ae2e",
