                                                "sense_id": "1cdb07dd-d5a0-3bf4-b80f-18be9f60ae2e",
                                                "text": "Speak to me , muse , the man , who after Troy was sack'd , Saw many towns and men , and could their manners tract."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
